{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32616","headline":"旅馆书怀 · 刘沧","name":"旅馆书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋看庭树换风烟，兄弟飘零寄海边。\n客计倦行分陕路，家贫休种汶阳田。\n云低远塞鸣寒鴈，雨歇空山噪暮蝉。\n落叶虫丝满窗户，秋堂独坐思悠然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}